{"name":"Wilderness","hex":"#8f886c","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Wilderness","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A forested region of central Virginia.","The Battle of the Wilderness, 1864, which occurred there."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["An unincorporated community in Spotsylvania County, Orange County, Virginia, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Wilderness"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wilderness","blocks":[{"text":"Wilderness or wildlands are Earth's natural environments that have not been significantly modified by human activity, or any nonurbanized land not under extensive agricultural cultivation. The term has traditionally referred to terrestrial environments, though growing attention is being placed on marine wilderness. Recent maps of wilderness suggest it covers roughly one-quarter of Earth's terrestrial surface, but is being rapidly degraded by human activity. Even less wilderness remains in the ocean, with only 13.2% free from intense human activity."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Beech_Forest_%28AU%29%2C_Great_Otway_National_Park%2C_Beauchamp_Falls_--_2019_--_1271.jpg/330px-Beech_Forest_%28AU%29%2C_Great_Otway_National_Park%2C_Beauchamp_Falls_--_2019_--_1271.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilderness","wikidata":"Q911871"},{"title":"Wilderness (2023 TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Wilderness is a British psychological thriller miniseries produced for Amazon Prime Video based on the novel of the same name by B. E. Jones. It stars Jenna Coleman, Oliver Jackson-Cohen and Ashley Benson. It was released on 15 September 2023."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/89/Wilderness_%282023_TV_series%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilderness_(2023_TV_series)","w